WEBVTT

00:06:29.846 --> 00:06:31.814
the book of nature is written.

00:06:33.223 --> 00:06:34.380
Look at the world.

00:06:34.404 --> 00:06:38.197
You don't see equations
carved on the mountainsides.

00:06:39.000 --> 00:06:41.720
If you did, it would be because
people had carved them.

00:06:42.650 --> 00:06:44.732
By the way, why don't we do that?

00:06:44.756 --> 00:06:45.832
(Laughter)

00:06:45.856 --> 00:06:47.365
What's wrong with us?

00:06:47.389 --> 00:06:48.833
(Laughter)

00:06:48.857 --> 00:06:51.496
Empiricism is inadequate

00:06:51.520 --> 00:06:57.783
because, well, scientific theories
explain the seen in terms of the unseen.

00:06:57.807 --> 00:07:00.392
And the unseen, you have to admit,